        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The diagrams below compare the layout of a typical Japanese office and a typical American office. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>The diagrams below compare the layout of a typical Japanese office and a typical American office. </strong></em></span><em style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Offices in Japan vs in America</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">Đề b&agrave;i Offices in Japan vs in America y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về bố cục của hai loại văn ph&ograve;ng (Japanese v&agrave; American), chỉ ra những đặc điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; so s&aacute;nh sự kh&aacute;c biệt giữa ch&uacute;ng.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Offices in Japan vs in America với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: bố cục văn ph&ograve;ng điển h&igrave;nh của Japanese - bố cục văn ph&ograve;ng điển h&igrave;nh của American.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U7iadbsa0o9CMOxYDBClUkAhgse\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework <sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với đề Offices in Japan vs in America dạng map so s&aacute;nh tĩnh, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZYodOsfSod6E5xJw0Flch6wgZd\" data-list=\"bullet\">Hai phong c&aacute;ch văn ph&ograve;ng cho thấy c&aacute;c<strong> c&aacute;ch tiếp cận tương phản&nbsp;</strong><em>(contrasting approaches)</em> trong thiết kế nơi l&agrave;m việc, với văn ph&ograve;ng Japanese c&oacute; <strong>bố cục mở <em>(</em></strong><em>open layout)</em>, trong khi văn ph&ograve;ng Americanbao gồm <strong>c&aacute;c kh&ocirc;ng gian ri&ecirc;ng biệt được bao bọc</strong><em> (separate enclosed spaces).</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XS6XduQ67oL350xRUvOlsoiKgob\" data-list=\"bullet\">Thiết kế Japanese c&oacute;<strong> sự sắp xếp ph&acirc;n cấp r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong> <em>(clear hierarchical arrangement)</em>, trong khi bố cục American chia kh&ocirc;ng gian th&agrave;nh <strong>c&aacute;c khu vực chức năng</strong><em> (functional areas).</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework <sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i Offices in Japan vs in America một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c sự thay đổi dựa tr&ecirc;n ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; so s&aacute;nh giữa hai loại văn ph&ograve;ng:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FKLxd8T0jomlW3xlEQ5lfJGxgwb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1: </strong><strong>Văn ph&ograve;ng Japanese</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xz8Sd3833oJVsmxgnsUlprJUgUb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework <sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JUA4dxEvgohR9ZxnhsblIGlIgJf\" data-list=\"bullet\">Cấu tr&uacute;c tổng thể: kh&ocirc;ng gian mở với quản l&yacute; cấp cao&nbsp;<strong>ở vị tr&iacute; trung t&acirc;m ph&iacute;a tr&ecirc;n</strong> <em>(positioned at the top center)</em>.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PcKbdkvyNoYKcfxcLnflaBuogPh\" data-list=\"bullet\">hai section managers <strong>nằm ở hai b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i v&agrave; phải</strong> <em>(located on the left and right sides)</em>.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PcKbdkvyNoYKcfxcLnflaBuogPh\" data-list=\"bullet\">c&aacute;c b&agrave;n l&agrave;m việc được sắp xếp theo <strong>ba h&agrave;ng trong hai cột bằng nhau</strong> <em>(three rows of employee desks arranged in two equal columns).</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PcKbdkvyNoYKcfxcLnflaBuogPh\" data-list=\"bullet\">to&agrave;n bộ văn ph&ograve;ng <strong>hướng về cửa sổ ở tường ph&iacute;a bắc</strong><em> (faces windows on the north wall).</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<br>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">BODY 2:</span>&nbsp;<strong>Văn ph&ograve;ng American</strong></span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrA9dgGjNoRCVUxfgJ1lOWFlglh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework <sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P4tHdz1hUolSqWxwKZrl2KT7g8t\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">Cấu tr&uacute;c tổng thể: <strong>chia kh&ocirc;ng gian th&agrave;nh c&aacute;c khu vực c&oacute; chức năng ri&ecirc;ng biệt</strong> <em>(divides the space into areas with distinct functions).</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DpUedAbEIotdF1x6VAClL5NNgXb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">khu vực b&ecirc;n phải:<strong> c&aacute;c văn ph&ograve;ng ri&ecirc;ng</strong> <em>(private offices)</em> cho quản l&yacute;, bao gồm ph&ograve;ng ri&ecirc;ng cho section managers v&agrave; department manager ở <strong>g&oacute;c dưới b&ecirc;n phải</strong><em> (bottom right).</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DpUedAbEIotdF1x6VAClL5NNgXb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">khu vực trung t&acirc;m: <strong>c&aacute;c khoang l&agrave;m việc ri&ecirc;ng được sắp xếp th&agrave;nh bốn h&agrave;ng</strong><em> (individual cubicles arranged in four rows).</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DpUedAbEIotdF1x6VAClL5NNgXb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">khu vực b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i: c&aacute;c ph&ograve;ng chức năng bao gồm copy room, storage, v&agrave; hai conference rooms, tất cả đều nằm <strong>gần cửa sổ tường ph&iacute;a t&acirc;y<em> </em></strong><em>(adjacent to the west wall's windows).</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2000,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K0nXdQynUoC2yaxrI1ylCnkQgug\">The diagrams show the different layouts of typical Japanese and American offices.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18746,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2001,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, the two office styles show contrasting approaches to workplace design, with the Japanese office featuring an open layout, while the American office consists of separate enclosed spaces. The Japanese design has a clear hierarchical arrangement, whereas the American layout divides the space into functional areas.</p>",
            "question_id": 18746,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2002,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>Looking at the Japanese office, the workspace uses an open-plan design with the department manager positioned at the top center. Two section managers are located on the left and right sides, each overseeing three rows of employee desks arranged in a grid pattern and organized in two equal columns. The whole office faces windows on the north wall, with the department manager's workspace aligned accordingly.</p>",
            "question_id": 18746,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2003,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p>In contrast, the American office divides the space into areas with distinct functions. The right side contains private offices for managers, including separate rooms for two section managers and a department manager office at the bottom right. The center area has individual cubicles arranged in four rows, giving employees personal workspace. Meanwhile, the left side features functional rooms including a copy room at the top, a storage area, and two conference rooms at the bottom, all of which are adjacent to the west wall's windows.</p>",
            "question_id": 18746,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
